Cell["\<\
For a square lattice periodic along x and layered along y, obtain the \
in-plane dispersion and coupling between neighboring layers.\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->1309367124,ExpressionUUID->"b23c8eed-caf6-5245-b844-41ca899b79d3"],

